## **Course & Project Information**

- **Course:** Database Systems
- **Project Type:** CCP-3 – Complete Database Implementation
- **Database:** MySQL
- **Backend:** Node.js & Express.js
- **Frontend:** React.js
- **API Integration:** OpenRouteService
- **Normalization:** Third Normal Form (3NF)
- **Version Control:** Git & GitHub

---

# **CCP-3 – Database Implementation**

CCP-3 focuses on converting the conceptual database design into a fully implemented and operational system. This phase includes database implementation, normalization verification, frontend development, backend development, API integration, database programmability, and business rule enforcement.

### Key Deliverables

- Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD) Design
- Relational Schema Development
- Functional Dependency Analysis
- Candidate Key Identification
- Database Normalization up to Third Normal Form (3NF)
- Referential Integrity Implementation
- Constraint Enforcement

---

---

# **Database Components**

### Core Entities (15 Tables)

| Entity | Description |
| ------ | ----------- |
| User | System users with role-based access |
| Driver | Driver information and records |
| Company | Transport company details |
| EndCustomer | Customer information |
| VehicleCategory | Vehicle type classification |
| Vehicle | Fleet vehicle registry |
| Truck | Truck-specific attributes |
| Shipment | Shipment details and tracking |
| DriverAssignment | Driver-vehicle assignment records |
| Agreement | Service agreements |
| Invoice | Billing invoices |
| Payment | Payment transactions |
| DeliveryVerification | Proof of delivery |
| ShipmentStatusLog | Status change history |
| CancellationRequest | Order cancellation requests |

---

# **Database Automation**

## Implemented Triggers (19)

<details>
<summary><b>Click to View Complete Trigger List</b></summary>

| # | Trigger Name | Purpose |
| - | ------------ | ------- |
| 1 | trg_generate_tracking_id | Auto-generates unique tracking IDs |
| 2 | trg_generate_invoice_number | Creates sequential invoice numbers |
| 3 | trg_calculate_delivery_charges | Computes charges based on distance |
| 4 | trg_create_delivery_verification | Creates delivery verification record |
| 5 | trg_prevent_status_regression | Prevents backward status changes |
| 6 | trg_log_shipment_status | Logs all status changes |
| 7 | trg_update_vehicle_status | Updates vehicle availability |
| 8 | trg_update_driver_status | Updates driver availability |
| 9 | trg_update_truck_status_on_assignment | Updates truck status |
| 10 | trg_truck_load_on_shipment_assign | Manages truck load capacity |
| 11 | trg_truck_load_on_shipment_done | Updates load on completion |
| 12 | trg_block_full_truck_assignment | Prevents assignment to full trucks |
| 13 | trg_auto_generate_invoice | Auto-generates invoice |
| 14 | trg_deduct_wallet_balance | Deducts wallet balance |
| 15 | trg_block_inactive_company_shipment | Blocks inactive company shipments |
| 16 | trg_notify_admin_new_company | Alerts admin on registration |
| 17 | trg_calculate_cancellation_charge | Calculates cancellation fees |
| 18 | trg_apply_cancellation_on_approval | Processes cancellation |
| 19 | trg_notify_finance_cod_payment | Notifies finance for COD |

</details>

